{
  "id": "chapter-07",
  "kind": "chapter",
  "label": "Chapter 7",
  "title": "YOU DON’T SEE PEOPLE — YOU SEE YOUR STATE",
  "shortTitle": "You See Your State",
  "file": "chapters/15-chapter-07.json",
  "index": 15,
  "sourceRange": [
    2093,
    2252
  ],
  "number": "Chapter 7",
  "headerSourceParagraphs": {
    "number": 2093,
    "title": 2094
  },
  "phase": "Arc I - The Distortion",
  "sourceHeadingParagraphs": [
    2093,
    2094
  ],
  "elements": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "There is a point in life where you slowly start believing that you are understanding people."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2095
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "You think you are reading them."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2096
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "You think you are decoding their behaviour."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2097
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But slowly, almost invisibly, something else is happening underneath:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2098
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "you are not seeing them at all."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2099
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "You are only seeing yourself — in different emotional conditions."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2100
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And the worst part is, it feels like truth."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2101
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not interpretation. Not assumption. Truth."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2102
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "THE ILLUSION OF “OBJECTIVE SEEING”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2104
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Human mind has this built-in illusion that it observes reality directly."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2105
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But observation is never clean."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2106
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It is always mixed with:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2107
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "past memory"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2108
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "current emotion"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2109
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "expectation"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2110
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "fear"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2111
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "attachment level"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2112
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And this mixture becomes the lens."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2113
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "You don’t see the world first and then feel."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2114
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "You feel first — and then the world gets shaped."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2115
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "REAL LIFE SCENE: THE SAME MESSAGE, DIFFERENT REALITIES",
          "bold": true
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2117,
      "role": "section-heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Imagine this:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2118
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A simple message arrives — “ok”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2119
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "That’s it. One word."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2120
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Now observe what happens internally."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2121
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "On a normal, stable day: It is just a reply. Nothing more."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2122
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "On a slightly low day: “ok… maybe he is busy.”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2123
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "On an insecure day: “ok… something is wrong.”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2124
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "On an attached day: “ok… he doesn’t care anymore.”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2125
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Same message. Same person. Same situation."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2126
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But internally, four completely different worlds are created."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2127
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And the person on the other side didn’t change even once."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2128
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "WHY THIS HAPPENS WITHOUT YOU NOTICING",
          "bold": true
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2130,
      "role": "section-heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Because your mind is not a camera."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2131
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It is a meaning-making machine."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2132
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It cannot tolerate empty space."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2133
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "So"
        },
        {
          "text": " when something is unclear — tone, silence, delay — it immediately fills it."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2134
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not with truth."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2135
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "With possibility."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2136
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And possibility is always shaped by your current emotional state."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2137
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "SILENCE IS NEVER SILENCE",
          "bold": true
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2139,
      "role": "section-heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Take another example."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2140
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Someone sees your message and doesn’t reply."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2141
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Fact: no reply."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2142
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But your mind refuses to stop there."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2143
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It starts building layers:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2144
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“"
        },
        {
          "text": "busy"
        },
        {
          "text": " hoga”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2145,
      "role": "quote-line"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“"
        },
        {
          "text": "ya"
        },
        {
          "text": " ignore kar raha hai”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2146,
      "role": "quote-line"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“"
        },
        {
          "text": "ya"
        },
        {
          "text": " interest kam ho gaya”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2147,
      "role": "quote-line"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“"
        },
        {
          "text": "ya"
        },
        {
          "text": " maine kuch galat bola”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2148,
      "role": "quote-line"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And slowly, what was a neutral silence becomes a full emotional story."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2149
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not because something happened."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2150
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But because your mind cannot sit with “nothing happening.”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2151
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "THE INTERNAL PROJECTION SYSTEM",
          "bold": true
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2153,
      "role": "section-heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Here is the uncomfortable truth:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2154
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "You don’t interpret people’s behaviour."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2155
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "You project your internal condition onto their behaviour."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2156
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "If you are calm — everything looks normal."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2157
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "If you are anxious — everything looks suspicious."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2158
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "If you are attached — everything feels personal."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2159
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "If you are emotionally drained — everything feels distant."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2160
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Nothing outside changes."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2161
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But everything inside changes the meaning of outside."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2162
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "REAL LIFE SCENE: FRIENDSHIP SHIFT",
          "bold": true
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2164,
      "role": "section-heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A friendship starts."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2165
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "At first everything feels natural."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2166
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Replies don’t matter. Timing doesn’t matter. Silence doesn’t matter."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2167
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Then slowly attachment increases."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2168
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Now delay starts having weight."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2169
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A late reply is not just delay anymore — it is a signal."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2170
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Then expectation enters."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2171
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And expectation is the turning point where interpretation begins replacing experience."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2172
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Finally, one day you say:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2173
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“Woh badal gaya.”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2174,
      "role": "quote-line"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But what actually changed was not the person."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2175
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It was your sensitivity to distance."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2176
    },
    {
      "type": "section-break",
      "role": "source-space"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "WHY PEOPLE FEEL LIKE THEY CHANGE",
          "bold": true
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2179,
      "role": "section-heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Because you don’t meet people in one fixed state."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2180
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "You meet them through different versions of yourself:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2181
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "version that is secure"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2182
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "version that is doubtful"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2183
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "version that is attached"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2184
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "version that is detached"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2185
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And each version creates a different “truth” about the same person."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2186
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "So"
        },
        {
          "text": " when you say:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2187
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“"
        },
        {
          "text": "pehle"
        },
        {
          "text": " aisa nahi tha”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2188,
      "role": "quote-line"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "what you are really saying is:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2189
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“"
        },
        {
          "text": "pehle"
        },
        {
          "text": " main aisa nahi tha jab main usko aise dekh raha tha.”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2190,
      "role": "quote-line"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "THE BREAKING POINT: WHEN ASSUMPTION FEELS LIKE REALITY",
          "bold": true
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2192,
      "role": "section-heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "The most dangerous shift happens quietly."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2193
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "At first:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2194
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“"
        },
        {
          "text": "shayad"
        },
        {
          "text": " aisa ho”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2195,
      "role": "quote-line"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Then:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2196
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“"
        },
        {
          "text": "lag"
        },
        {
          "text": " raha hai aisa hi hai”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2197,
      "role": "quote-line"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Then:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2198
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“"
        },
        {
          "text": "obviously"
        },
        {
          "text": " aisa hi hai”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2199,
      "role": "quote-line"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And finally:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2200
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“"
        },
        {
          "text": "main"
        },
        {
          "text": " jaanta hoon yeh sach hai”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2201,
      "role": "quote-line"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "At this point, assumption stops being flexible."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2202
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It becomes identity-backed belief."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2203
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And once belief forms, curiosity dies."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2204
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "THE LOSS OF DIRECT EXPERIENCE",
          "bold": true
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2206,
      "role": "section-heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Slowly, life stops being experienced."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2207
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It starts being analyzed."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2208
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A laugh is no longer just a laugh."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2209
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A pause is no longer just a pause."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2210
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A message is no longer just a message."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2211
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Everything becomes a signal for something deeper."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2212
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And ironically, while trying to understand everything deeper…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2213
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "you lose the surface completely."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2214
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But surface is where reality actually exists."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2215
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "WHY THIS SYSTEM IS HARD TO NOTICE",
          "bold": true
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2217,
      "role": "section-heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Because it feels intelligent."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2218
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It feels like awareness."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2219
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It feels like emotional intelligence."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2220
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But often, it is just pattern recognition mixed with fear."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2221
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And fear always wants certainty."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2222
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "So"
        },
        {
          "text": " it creates meaning even when meaning doesn’t exist."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2223
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "THE MOST UNCOMFORTABLE REALIZATION",
          "bold": true
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2225,
      "role": "section-heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "You are not reacting to people."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2226
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "You are reacting to your internal memory of similar situations."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2227
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "One silence today is not just today."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2228
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It carries every past silence with it."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2229
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "One delay today is not just timing."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2230
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It carries every past rejection with it."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2231
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "So present never stays present."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2232
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It becomes a carrier of everything unresolved."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2233
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "WHEN YOU FINALLY SEE IT",
          "bold": true
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2235,
      "role": "section-heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "There is no dramatic moment."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2236
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "No enlightenment feeling."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2237
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Just a quiet realization:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2238
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“I am not seeing what is happening. I am seeing what I am.”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 2239,
      "role": "quote-line"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And that realization doesn’t fix everything."
